<BaseLayout title="Affiliate disclosure | How Ancient China Worked" description="How How Ancient China Worked handles affiliate links and recommendations.">
  <section class="page-intro shell narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Site policy</p>
    <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p>Last updated: October 4, 2026</p>
  </section>
  <article class="article shell narrow prose">
    <p>How Ancient China Worked may, in the future, use affiliate links in reading guides and resource pages. An affiliate link means we may earn a small commission if you make a qualifying purchase after following the link, at no additional cost to you.</p>
    <p>We choose recommendations for their relevance to the topic and the reader, not because of a commission. A commercial relationship will not determine an article’s historical conclusions.</p>
    <p>At present, this site does not use affiliate links. If affiliate links are added, the relevant page will include a clear disclosure before or near those links, and this policy will be updated.</p>
    <p>When applicable, this site will use the program-specific disclosure required by the relevant affiliate program.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
